<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN WEDNESDAY SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN WEDNESDAY SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singles schedule on the 10th day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT start, Tuesday)</p>
<p>14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) v Dominique van Roost (Belgium)</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) v 4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) v 5-Thomas Muster (Austria)</p>
<p>Night session (0800 GMT start)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v 10-Albert Costa (Spain).</p>
</text>
